    "# Feature aggregation"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "This part focuses on the **feature aggregation** approach to dimensionality reduction. It uses a grouping of original features and summarizes each group into one aggregated feature. \n",
    "\n",
    "<center><img src=\"./figures/feature_aggregation.png\" width=\"700\"/></center>\n",
    "\n",
    "Depending on how we obtain groups of original features, we distinguish **knowledge-based** and **data-driven** feature aggregation approaches. \n",
    "\n",
    "Click on the button below to open this notebook in the Colab environment.\n",
    "\n",
    "[![Open In Colab](https://colab.research.google.com/assets/colab-badge.svg)](https://colab.research.google.com/github/HelmholtzAI-Consultants-Munich/DimRed-Course/blob/main/notebooks/3_feature_aggregation.ipynb)"
   ]
